  "html": "<h2 id=\"140-2026-10-30\"><a href=\"#140-2026-10-30\">1.4.0 (2026-10-30)</a></h2>\n<h3 id=\"turn-off-automatic-guides-42\"><a href=\"#turn-off-automatic-guides-42\">Turn off automatic guides (<a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-matrix-rmapi/pull/42\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#42</a>)</a></h3>\n<p>The first page of the guide now has a \"do not show me guides automatically\"\r\noption. Picking it closes the guide and stops guides opening on their own\r\nhere and elsewhere in Deploy App. The info button still opens the guide when\r\nyou want it.</p>\n<h2 id=\"changelog\"><a href=\"#changelog\">Changelog</a></h2>\n<h3 id=\"features\"><a href=\"#features\">Features</a></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>honour the Deploy App guide opt-out (<a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-matrix-rmapi/commit/17600af8dd783b993daeaef91f47752c76509402\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">17600af</a>)</li>\n<li>attach release-notes to release (<a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-matrix-rmapi/commit/73243833552bfffedfccc4c65260e601cfac229b\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">7324383</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"fixes\"><a href=\"#fixes\">Fixes</a></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>deps:</strong> update filelock and uv (<a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-matrix-rmapi/commit/4a547aa8ffbe8897624a35ac4f3037bd76ce7bde\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">4a547aa</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"other-changes\"><a href=\"#other-changes\">Other changes</a></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>main:</strong> release 1.4.0 (<a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-matrix-rmapi/commit/610be43dbf5155493ee11a4ec0ec445492c72572\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">610be43</a>)</li>\n<li><strong>docker:</strong> normalize stage keyword casing (<a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-matrix-rmapi/commit/10cbc6f035db9f3e7d5b257e32f8ba362ce51bd0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">10cbc6f</a>)</li>\n<li>use hosted runners for lightweight checks (<a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-matrix-rmapi/commit/f9482a7c351c468df2da173f4ae17c3596aec706\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">f9482a7</a>)</li>\n<li><strong>deps:</strong> update Kraftwerk helper image (<a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-matrix-rmapi/commit/2d93a6f81bb0c7a45c3793151648b93187af8d53\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">2d93a6f</a>)</li>\n<li>allow generated lockfile in bootstrap (<a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-matrix-rmapi/commit/97886f9b0dbeca8483c2b8708b420307acd7d6b7\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">97886f9</a>)</li>\n<li><strong>deps:</strong> refresh dependencies (<a href=\"https://github.com/pvarki/python-matrix-rmapi/commit/aaaf2c872fd22132a23618d4092be85ff1120a3a\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">aaaf2c8</a>)</li>\n</ul>"
